                  <div class="grammar-theory-usage-box usage-plural">
                    <div class="usage-box-header">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users-round"><path d="M18 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"></path><circle cx="10" cy="8" r="5"></circle><path d="M22 20c0-3.37-2-6.5-4-8a5 5 0 0 0-.45-8.3"></path></svg>
                      <strong>Số nhiều</strong>
                    </div>
                    <p class="usage-box-text">We, They, danh từ số nhiều, These, Those</p>
                    <p class="usage-box-result text-green">→ V nguyên mẫu</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </section>

              <!-- Mistakes (col-span-6) -->
              <section class="grammar-theory-card grammar-theory-mistakes">
                <div class="grammar-theory-card-badge">
                  <span class="grammar-theory-badge-icon badge-warning">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg>
                  </span>
                  <h3 class="grammar-theory-badge-title text-warning">Bẫy thường gặp</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="grammar-theory-mistakes-list" id="theoryMistakes">
                  <div class="mistake-item">
                    <div class="mistake-item-header">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-x"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m15 9-6 6"></path><path d="m9 9 6 6"></path></svg>
                      <span>Bẫy 1: Stative verbs không dùng tiếp diễn</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mistake-item-body">Các động từ như know, believe, belong, contain, seem, want, need, understand, prefer — KHÔNG bao giờ chia ở dạng tiếp diễn. Sai: I am knowing the answer. Đúng: I know the answer.</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="mistake-item">
                    <div class="mistake-item-header">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-x"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m15 9-6 6"></path><path d="m9 9 6 6"></path></svg>
                      <span>Bẫy 2: "Since" chỉ mốc thời gian, "For" chỉ khoảng thời gian</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mistake-item-body">TOEIC Part 5 thường đánh lừa bằng cách đặt since với khoảng thời gian (since two hours — sai) hoặc for với mốc thời gian (for last month — sai). Since + mốc: since Monday, since 2020. For + khoảng: for two hours, for a week.</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="mistake-item">
                    <div class="mistake-item-header">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-x"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m15 9-6 6"></path><path d="m9 9 6 6"></path></svg>
                      <span>Bẫy 3: Nhầm Present Perfect và Present Perfect Continuous</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mistake-item-body">Present Perfect nhấn mạnh kết quả (I have written 10 emails). Present Perfect Continuous nhấn mạnh quá trình liên tục (I have been writing emails all morning). TOEIC Part 5 thường hỏi sự khác biệt này.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </section>

              <!-- Examples (col-span-6) -->
              <section class="grammar-theory-card grammar-theory-examples">
                <div class="grammar-theory-card-badge">
                  <span class="grammar-theory-badge-icon badge-pink">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg>
                  </span>
                  <h3 class="grammar-theory-badge-title text-pink">Ví dụ</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="grammar-theory-examples-list" id="theoryExamples">
                  <div class="example-item">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote quote-icon"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path></svg>
                    <div class="example-copy">
                      <p class="example-text">The company launches its new product line every quarter.</p>
                      <p class="example-subtext">Công ty ra mắt dòng sản phẩm mới mỗi quý. (Present Simple — thói quen định kỳ)</p>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" aria-label="Lưu ví dụ"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bookmark"><path d="m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"></path></svg></button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="example-item">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote quote-icon"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path></svg>
                    <div class="example-copy">
                      <p class="example-text">The marketing team is preparing the campaign materials this week.</p>
                      <p class="example-subtext">Đội ngũ tiếp thị đang chuẩn bị tài liệu chiến dịch trong tuần này. (Present Continuous — tình huống tạm thời)</p>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" aria-label="Lưu ví dụ"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bookmark"><path d="m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"></path></svg></button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </section>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="practiceQuestionMap" class="practice-question-map" hidden>
      <aside class="practice-map-drawer" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"
        aria-labelledby="practiceQuestionMapTitle">
        <header class="practice-map-header">
          <span class="practice-map-header-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i
              class="fa-solid fa-border-all"></i></span>
          <div class="practice-map-header-copy">
            <h2 id="practiceQuestionMapTitle">Bản đồ câu hỏi</h2>
            <p id="practiceQuestionMapProgress"></p>
          </div>
          <button id="practiceQuestionMapClose" type="button"
            aria-label="Đóng bản đồ câu hỏi">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </header>
        <div class="practice-map-filters" role="group"
          aria-label="Lọc câu hỏi">
          <button class="practice-map-filter" type="button"
            data-map-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">Tất
            cả</button>
          <button class="practice-map-filter" type="button"
            data-map-filter="unanswered" aria-pressed="false">Chưa
            làm</button>
          <button class="practice-map-filter" type="button"
            data-map-filter="incorrect" aria-pressed="false">Làm
            sai</button>
        </div>
        <div class="practice-map-scroll"
          id="practiceQuestionMapContent"></div>
        <p class="practice-map-legend">
          <span><i class="practice-map-dot current"></i> Đang
            làm</span>
          <span><i class="practice-map-dot correct"></i> Đúng</span>
          <span><i class="practice-map-dot incorrect"></i> Sai</span>
          <span><i class="practice-map-dot"></i> Chưa làm</span>
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div id="practiceReportDialog" class="practice-report-overlay" hidden>
      <div class="practice-report-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"
        aria-labelledby="practiceReportTitle">
        <div class="practice-report-head">
          <span class="practice-report-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-flag"><path d="M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z"/><line x1="4" x2="4" y1="22" y2="15"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div class="practice-report-title-group">
            <h2 id="practiceReportTitle">Báo lỗi nội dung</h2>
            <p id="practiceReportSubtitle">Phản hồi giúp đội ngũ rà soát lại câu hỏi.</p>
          </div>
          <button id="practiceReportClose" class="practice-report-close" type="button" aria-label="Đóng">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="practice-report-body">
          <p class="practice-report-question" id="practiceReportQuestion"></p>

          <span class="practice-report-label">LOẠI LỖI</span>
          <div class="practice-report-options" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Loại lỗi">
            <button type="button" class="practice-report-chip" data-report-category="Sai đáp án" aria-pressed="true">Sai đáp án</button>
            <button type="button" class="practice-report-chip" data-report-category="Lỗi chính tả / diễn đạt" aria-pressed="false">Lỗi chính tả / diễn đạt</button>
            <button type="button" class="practice-report-chip" data-report-category="Lỗi khác" aria-pressed="false">Lỗi khác</button>
          </div>

          <label class="practice-report-label" for="practiceReportDetails">
            MÔ TẢ THÊM <span>(không bắt buộc)</span>
          </label>
          <textarea id="practiceReportDetails"
            placeholder="Ví dụ: đáp án C mới đúng vì..."
            maxlength="1000"
            aria-label="Mô tả thêm"></textarea>

          <p class="practice-report-status" id="practiceReportStatus"
            role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>

        <div class="practice-report-actions">
          <button id="practiceReportCancel" type="button">Huỷ</button>
          <button id="practiceReportSubmit" type="button">Gửi báo lỗi</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="practiceReportToast" class="practice-report-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>

    <!-- Dialog xác nhận làm lại chủ đề -->
    <div id="resetTopicModal" class="grammar-dialog-backdrop" hidden>
      <div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Làm lại chủ đề này?" tabindex="-1" class="relative z-10 flex max-h-[88dvh] w-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card shadow-2xl outline-none animate-fade-up motion-reduce:animate-none sm:max-w-md bg-white">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 border-b border-border px-5 py-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary" style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(118,87,255,0.12);color:#7657ff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw size-5"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground" style="margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;">Làm lại chủ đề này?</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button id="resetTopicClose" type="button" class="inline-flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary lg:size-9" style="width:36px;height:36px;border:none;background:transparent;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#64748b;" aria-label="Đóng">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x size-4"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="premium-scrollbar min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-5 py-5" style="padding:20px;">
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground" style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#64748b;">Toàn bộ đáp án đã làm ở chủ đề này sẽ bị xoá và độ chính xác của chủ đề trở về 0.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-border px-5 py-4" style="border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:16px 20px;">
          <div class="flex justify-end gap-2" style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;">
            <button id="resetTopicCancel" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-semibold transition-all border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-10 px-4 py-2" style="height:40px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#ffffff;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;cursor:pointer;">Huỷ</button>
            <button id="resetTopicConfirm" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-semibold transition-all bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90 h-10 px-4 py-2" style="height:40px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:none;background:#ef4444;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;cursor:pointer;">Làm lại từ đầu</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
}

@section Scripts {
    <form id="grammarAntiforgery" hidden>@Html.AntiForgeryToken()</form>
    <script>
      window.GRAMMAR_DATA = @Html.Raw(ViewBag.GrammarDataJson ?? "{\"groups\":[],\"state\":{}}");
      window.GRAMMAR_API = {
        submitAnswer: "@Url.Action("SubmitAnswer", "Grammar")",
        resetTopic: "@Url.Action("ResetTopic", "Grammar")",
        setBookmark: "@Url.Action("SetBookmark", "Grammar")",
        saveNote: "@Url.Action("SaveNote", "Grammar")",
        removeNote: "@Url.Action("RemoveNote", "Grammar")",
        reportQuestion: "@Url.Action("ReportQuestion", "Grammar")",
        submitMiniTest: "@Url.Action("SubmitMiniTest", "Grammar")"
      };
    </script>
    <script src="~/assets/js/Grammar/grammar-main.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
}